  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nThe expression = (7.35×7.35-2.25×2.25)/(0.24)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na² - b² = (a + b) × (a - b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (7.35×7.35-2.25×2.25)/(0.24)\n\n⇒ {(7.35 - 2.25) times (7.35 + 2.25)over 0.24}={5.1times 9.6over0.24}={48.96over0.24}=204\n\n**∴ The required result will be 204.**",
